<title>NIGERIA: HEINEKEN UPS STAKE IN NIGERIAN BREWERIES.</title>
<headline>HEINEKEN UPS STAKE IN NIGERIAN BREWERIES.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch brewer Heineken has raised its holdings in Nigerian Breweries Plc to 28 percent from 13.4 percent, the Nigerian company said on Monday.</p>
<p>This followed the divestment of Britain's Unilever  from the Nigerian firm leaving the shares which were taken up by Heineken, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
